Pinned current main source: `84a75eae1b46d155656f10e9278373726a808fbb`. This recheck inspected source only and found the reported contract still present; no build, test, runtime reproduction, or installed application was run. Latest release v0.6.0 source: `53a5880386789fc3531e54f6e6ffdef9a8e41f1a`. The same failed contract remains in the inspected release source; no released executable was tested.

- Source baseline: `f3571c591f0ec4ee7faea67c011b3ee1eb6ba913`.
- Entry point: the public `pdfcraft_fonts::pdf::Metrics` constructor and encoder. No product build, test execution, rendering, or save/reopen check was performed.

